__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The BEAM writes this where it dies; the trope gate runs elixir.
erl_crash.dump

# The Quarto site. Pages under RFD directories and the serials table are written
# by `scripts/render_site.py` from the README and the register, so committing them
# would put the same content in two places -- which is what moved `serials.qmd`
# out of this repository in the first place.
_site/
.quarto/
rfd/1[0-9]*-*/index.md
pages/serials.md

# The fourloops layers live in rfd/1143-keypoints-to-anny/, the first loop. default.xml links them to this root and into
# each of the four RFDs that scope them, so every Scope naming the bare filename
# resolves beside its own document. The links are not committed as second copies.
/fourloops-plan.usda
/fourloops-etnf.usda
rfd/114[4-6]-*/fourloops-plan.usda
rfd/114[4-6]-*/fourloops-etnf.usda
